  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A small object of mass <em>M </em>moves at constant speed <em>v </em>in a vertical circle on a string of length <em>R</em>. Point A is at the top of the circle.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the tension in the string at point B?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\\left (\\frac{v^{2}}{R}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}g\\right )\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\\left (\\frac{v^{2}}{R}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}g\\right )\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\\left (\\frac{v^{2}}{R}-\\frac{1}{2}g\\right )\"></span> </li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\\left (\\frac{v^{2}}{R}+\\frac{1}{2}g\\right )\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
